# terraria (translated client): the language switch. First run -> English -> title -> Settings -> Language, then
# one language after the other (the game stays on the language list after a choice: Main.cs:49380-49386,
# LanguageManager.SetLanguage + SaveSettings): German, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean; a screenshot of
# the list in each, of the settings menu and the title in German and in Japanese. The culture of the selected
# language becomes the thread's culture (LanguageManager.cs:97-98).
# Legacy text menus are aimed at through the positions the game records for the gamepad (`aim menu K`: selectable
# item K; the list's heading is not selectable, so K = 0 is English ... 12 is Back).
